         recommended test: When the same requirement appears in two places in the task file, the derivation stage emits two obligations, one for each requirement occurrence.
           inputs:  Use a task file that states the same requirement in two separate places within the same file, with both statements clearly yielding obligations in derivation. The input must be one where a correct implementation emits two obligations and a defective implementation that collapses duplicates during derivation emits only one.
